# Exception: Flyway migration files must be committed - they are the
# versioned source of truth for auth-service's schema, not disposable
# scratch/dump SQL. Narrowly scoped to this one directory only; every
# other *.sql file in the repo remains ignored.
!services/auth-service/src/main/resources/db/migration/*.sql


